{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, move to object, pick it up, check weight, perform task or scan area. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />\"",
